Web analytics view (QY1.2, src/web/query.ts): the breakdown semantics of
PostHog/posthog products/web_analytics/backend/hogql_queries/stats_table.py
and the web vitals tiles (MIT; commit 7b13402a6350; nothing from `ee/`) are
re-implemented in Postgres SQL: page views of `$pageview`, entry referrer and
UTM per session, "$direct" without a referrer, p75 page speed with the
published thresholds. Same MIT notice as above.

Runtime dependencies (unmodified, from npm): hono and @hono/node-server
(MIT), pg (MIT), fflate (MIT), jose (MIT).

Test-only dependencies (unmodified, from npm): posthog-js (Apache-2.0 AND
MIT), posthog-node (MIT), posthog-react-native (MIT), @babel/runtime (MIT),
jsdom (MIT), playwright-core (Apache-2.0), typescript (Apache-2.0).
